\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {2}{\ignorespaces ContamCal three-stage pipeline. Stage~1 fuses training-free detection signals into per-item exposure scores via Reciprocal Rank Fusion. Stage~2 embeds these scores in a contamination-augmented 2PL IRT model, recovering clean ability estimates with credible intervals. Stage~3 classifies the resulting dose-response trajectories into canonical patterns.}}{3}{figure.caption.3}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:pipeline}{{2}{3}{ContamCal three-stage pipeline. Stage~1 fuses training-free detection signals into per-item exposure scores via Reciprocal Rank Fusion. Stage~2 embeds these scores in a contamination-augmented 2PL IRT model, recovering clean ability estimates with credible intervals. Stage~3 classifies the resulting dose-response trajectories into canonical patterns}{figure.caption.3}{}}
